---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_set_refund: refundPeriodSeconds in [1h, 14d]
    q_validate --> q_revert_params: invalid params
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidConfiguration
    q_set_refund --> q_set_fees: refundPeriodSeconds = param
    q_set_fees --> q_set_addrs: set fee bps (legion, referrer)
    q_set_addrs --> q_set_min: set projectAdmin, addressRegistry, bidToken
    q_set_min --> [*]: minimumInvestAmount = param, emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: refundPeriodSeconds between 1 hour and 2 weeks
        INV-002: minimumInvestAmount must be > 0
        INV-003: no endTime set at initialization (asynchronous design)
    end note
